  Mr.Ripper v0.20 alpha 6 11.03.2005
       Plugin for FAR v1.70b1+

With this plugin you can extract  some 
resources from any  files.  Mr. Ripper
now know over 25 file formats, such as
WAV, AVI,  BMP, JPG,  PNG, GIF,  DJVU,
MP3,  MOD, XM, IT, RTF  and much more.
Also plugin can  enter  in  many  game
archives. Over  40  famous and popular 
games supported. To support to formats
using RIP-modules (plugins for plugin)

Freeware for any not commercial using.

